She was with her friend named Lucy.

1264
00:54:12.690 --> 00:54:14.850
A cop was trying to pull them over.

1265
00:54:15.010 --> 00:54:18.990
And I guess the brakes must have not been working because they ended up driving over a

1266
00:54:18.990 --> 00:54:19.330
cliff.

1267
00:54:19.510 --> 00:54:21.590
And it was a total shock to everyone.

1268
00:54:22.050 --> 00:54:22.410
Okay.

1269
00:54:22.650 --> 00:54:25.110
Well, we wanted to get to the bottom of this.

1270
00:54:25.110 --> 00:54:29.890
So we reached out to the source, the writer of this episode, Jen Salata.

1271
00:54:30.110 --> 00:54:32.090
