She's like, no, that shouldn't be in here.

1342
00:58:01.250 --> 00:58:01.910
Get it out.

1343
00:58:02.110 --> 00:58:04.730
Well, she is not pleased and Angela, she's not wrong.

1344
00:58:05.010 --> 00:58:05.890
Thank you.

1345
00:58:06.090 --> 00:58:07.130
Thank you, Jenna.

1346
00:58:07.730 --> 00:58:08.510
You're welcome.

1347
00:58:08.810 --> 00:58:09.570
You're welcome.

