She wants to know, was that a real dead bird?

1350
00:58:17.530 --> 00:58:18.090
No.

1351
00:58:18.230 --> 00:58:19.130
No, no.

1352
00:58:19.130 --> 00:58:19.750
No, Ellie.

1353
