Yes.

1362
00:58:47.890 --> 00:58:48.290
Yes.

1363
00:58:48.510 --> 00:58:50.790
And I was just imagining it.

1364
00:58:50.790 --> 00:58:53.970
And I wrote him back and I said, Phil, were they on a silver tray?

1365
00:58:54.130 --> 00:58:55.730
And he said, you know me too well.

1366
