These are the moments in our show where I'm like, hey, babe, how was your day?

1367
00:59:01.390 --> 00:59:01.950
What'd you do today?

1368
00:59:02.610 --> 00:59:05.570
Well, I had to find three fake dead birds.

1369
00:59:06.430 --> 00:59:06.830
Yeah.

1370
00:59:06.830 --> 00:59:08.030
I scoured.

1371
00:59:08.430 --> 00:59:13.670
Or like when Greg goes home and his wife, Susanna, is like, hey, hon, how'd it go shooting

1372
00:59:13.670 --> 00:59:13.930
today?

1373
00:59:13.930 --> 00:59:14.750
He's like, great.

1374
00:59:14.890 --> 00:59:15.910
I picked a dead bird.

1375
00:59:16.370 --> 00:59:16.530
Yeah.

1376
00:59:16.990 --> 00:59:18.290
I picked the yellow one.

1377
00:59:18.450 --> 00:59:19.830
I made my dead bird selection.

1378
00:59:20.850 --> 00:59:21.730
Yes, exactly.

1379
00:59:22.210 --> 00:59:27.950
Well, Michael then tells the staff, attention, attention, we are holding a funeral for this

1380
00:59:27.950 --> 00:59:29.150
bird at 4 p.m.

1381
00:59:29.290 --> 00:59:30.090
in the parking lot.

1382
00:59:30.230 --> 00:59:30.690
Be there.

